{
  "about": "recall-desk eval cases. Every case is answerable from the recorded NHTSA fixtures (fixtures/nhtsa/manifest.json) and the fictional catalog (data/catalog.json), and every check in `expect` is decided by code in src/evals/grade.ts. `vehicle` names the recorded recall list the answer is checked against; `vehicle.bodyStyle` is the body style the question states or its VIN decodes to, used only by the tests that check this file against the fixtures. `plant` adds one invented complaint to the recorded complaints for that case only (src/evals/fixtures.ts); the recordings on disk are never changed. Type R is not covered: no Type R recall list is recorded.",
